      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is not a zero-sum game; it is a matter of establishing clear cultural boundaries. A welcoming policy must be predicated on the understanding that newcomers adopt the core values and traditions of the host nation. True integration requires assimilation into the established cultural framework, not just coexistence alongside it. When the foundational identity is respected, immigration can enrich, rather than destroy, the national spirit.",
      "source": "target",
